# Local dev trash (diagnostic scripts, response dumps, dev-server logs,
# commit-message drafts, scratch files). Underscore-prefixed names are
# the convention; dot-prefixed `_…` and dot-only debug files are also
# session artifacts. Patterns are explicit (not `_*` alone) so a real
# file like `dashboard.tsx` is never accidentally caught.
_trash_*
_trash-*
_*.cjs
_*.mjs
_*.html
_*.ps1
_*.py
_*.out
_*.err
_*.log
_*.tmp
_*.txt
_*.md
scratch-*
debug-*
_dev_*
._*.cjs
._*.mjs
._*.html
._*.ps1
._*.txt
.debug-*
.diag.*
.coord-*
.audit-*
.next-pid.txt
